<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Bundesliga matches played on Friday:</p>
<p>Bochum 1 (Waldoch 63rd minute) Borussia Dortmund 0. Halftime 0-0. Attendance 36,334.</p>
<p>VfB Stuttgart 4 (Bobic 12th, Schneider 39th, Elber 64th and 68th) Freiburg 2 (Decheiver 17th and 52nd). 2-1. 53,000.</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen 4 (Sergio 45th and 49th, Feldhoff 57th, Meijer 78th) Hansa Rostock 1 (Beinlich 8th). 1-1. 23,000.</p>
